# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored). Optional: where the app finds the web app's /api/v1 — no trailing slash.
# Unset: production, https://www.chiyali.com (dev and release builds alike).
# For a local `pnpm dev` in apps/web, use your computer's LAN address (a phone can't reach localhost):
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.10:3000
# After changing it, restart Metro with `npx expo start --clear` (it caches EXPO_PUBLIC_* values).
